description:
Vitality Leaf defines the environmental safety requirements of  products and servicies at all stages of the life cycle and methods for assessing compliance with these requirements.

Vitality Leaf is:
•	the only Russian ecolabel recognized by the international expert community;
•	for the consumer it is a guarantee of the environmental safety of the product for humans and the environment;
•	for the company it is a sign of leadership in the field of sustainable production and consumption, recognizable by consumers, business partners and industry experts
